WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,430
Brother Qiang, I have something else to do, so I’ll leave first.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:11,625
Have money in hand

3
00:00:11,625 --> 00:00:20,820
Don't panic

4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,820
After selling out that batch of black eagles last time,

5
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,820
Because there is a typhoon coming soon, I have to go home in a hurry

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,820
I didn't even have time to buy anything for my family.

7
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,200
Sixty-seven in total

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,200
Although it is still the period of planned economy

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,200
But the policy has been relaxed

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,200
As long as you don’t buy top-quality brocade scabbards

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,200
Basically no more receipts are needed
